2	// project's severity overrides and acceptances, order blocking-first, print each
3	// finding, and print the one-line summary.
4	// Returns the blocking count so a runner's exit code is `blocking ? 1 : 0`.
5	// `scopeLabel` only names the run in the summary line (e.g. "world" / "work") —
6	// this file carries no scope logic of its own.
